 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The COD pronouns",
   "texto": [
    "To avoid repeating the direct object, use **le** (lo), **la** (la) or **les** (los, las): **Je prends le médicament** → **Je le prends**.",
    "In front of Vowel or **h** muda, **le/la** is written **l'**: **J'aime le café** → **Je l'aime**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where the pronoun goes",
   "texto": [
    "The pronoun goes **delante del verbo conjugado**: **Je le prends**, **Tu la veux ?** (do you want it?).",
    "If there is an infinitive behind, the pronoun goes before the infinitive: **Je veux le voir** (I want to see it). It's not **Je le veux voir**."
   ]
  },
